{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2019-10", "window": 2, "start_date": 1570579200, "end_date": 1571183999, "month_true_total": 65, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:53:07 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "55616200", "author": {"steamid": "76561198181871878", "personaname": "鸩Cat", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198181871878/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 39761, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9556, "last_played": 1695052504, "avatar": "b1f618e5c1f854c98e2072cc3a8727695e983857"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "游戏不错，家里没矿的都跑来这里挖了。\n优化不是很好，对老机器不友好，硬盘问题？每次玩都会死机一两次，各位如果遇到我，玩着玩着突然没了，那就是死机了.\n折腾了几天后发现是显卡问题，运气好，一两小时不黑屏，运气不好上线就马上黑屏。\n又折腾了几下，好像又不是显卡的问题............", "timestamp_created": 1571150744, "timestamp_updated": 1575382650, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 4, "weighted_vote_score": "0.5004730224609375", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55614301", "author": {"steamid": "76561198217069428", "personaname": "efforts", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/976638294/", "num_games_owned": 32, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 5111, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2602, "last_played": 1722596020, "avatar": "da63e9df5ea8c2c38c61bf80b6e494e937cf6d3b"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "这个就是个刷刷刷的游戏，非常耐玩！强推！不需要基友也能和服务器的其他人联机，对独狼来说简直是福音。\n游戏4个角色，一个角色至少在30+小时以上的游玩快感。", "timestamp_created": 1571140303, "timestamp_updated": 1571140303, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.520435988903045654", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55610895", "author": {"steamid": "76561198415472114", "personaname": "StainU", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198415472114/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 31430, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 17346, "last_played": 1660372512, "avatar": "8dfe278c7493b6984540e57ecd57b791df13841e"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "优点不说了，建议游戏厂家参考下地狱潜兵，除了虫族外，增加两个星球，例如生化星球和光能者，武器更多样选择，带喷气跳跃背包等，难度再加大！！！", "timestamp_created": 1571114028, "timestamp_updated": 1571114028, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.478733032941818237", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55587733", "author": {"steamid": "76561198143390707", "personaname": "只道花无十日红", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Re-world/", "num_games_owned": 121, "num_reviews": 36, "playtime_forever": 17403, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3106, "last_played": 1706193915, "avatar": "1f3a117a283b59dcf0eb4707ff0b4dba78a7eb72"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "首先这是个刷刷刷游戏，其次这游戏的乐趣在于联机，然后没了。\n------------------------------------------\n2020/1/18\n一年多过去了游戏大变样，跟刚开始比起来可以说是单车变摩托，多了人物特长、枪械改装、枪械模组以及各种皮肤，还有深潜（连续3个任务，资源是一路保存下来的）还加了各种随机任务种类各不相同，总的来说越来越好了，期望完成的那一天尽快到来", "timestamp_created": 1570981556, "timestamp_updated": 1579288984, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52423858642578125", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date":